  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Send back 2000 forced out-of-school CHILDREN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citadel Charity Women Organization is a non-governmental organization that is committed to a mission that transcends borders and defies adversity. The issue we address is one that strikes at the very heart of humanity: the plight of children forcibly uprooted from their educational journey by the relentless insurgency in Nigeria. For over a decade, Boko Haram&apos;s violence has inflicted immeasurable suffering on communities, leaving a trail of destruction and displacement in its wake.</narrative>
  </description>
